      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my 2yo has been throwing up since this morning and has diarrhea too... he seems kinda sleepy and isnt really wanting to drink much. i don't really want to take him to the er if i don't have to. can i just make him some salt and sugar water at home to get his fluids up? what's the right way to do that so he's okay?",
